//**************************************************************************************
//**************************************************************************************
//
//		Player sounds
//
//**************************************************************************************
//**************************************************************************************

//Hack for a "no sound" in zandronum players. If you dont define a sound, call a 100% silent
//sound file, or call an invalid sound name, the engine in DM will use the default doom sounds.
//So this is a couple layers of "silent sound" hacks to ensure it works. The sound file itself
//makes a noise, but a very, very low one, then limimted the $volume to almost zero, but
//NOT zero, otherwise, again, the engine will just play the default. Thanks zandro!
NoSoundHax	"Sounds/NoSound.ogg"
$volume NoSoundHax 0.01


